  "slug": "pinrag",
  "name": "Pinrag",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Local RAG for your coding workflow. Index PDFs, YouTube videos, GitHub repos, and Discord exports, then query them with citations directly from Claude Code. Bundles an MCP server (pinrag-mcp via uvx) and a use-pinrag skill that maps natural-language requests to the right tool.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `use-pinrag` (Use when the PinRAG MCP server is enabled) and **1 MCP server**, `pinrag`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pinrag@claude-community` from `ndjordjevic/pinrag-plugin`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin for PinRAG: local RAG over PDFs, YouTube, GitHub repos, and Discord exports, with citations.",
